const verbs=[
["Identify","Name it. One word or phrase is enough. Don't over-explain.","Identify one push factor: War."],
["Define","Explain what the term means. Don't use the word to define itself.","Define devolution: Devolution is the transfer of power from a central government to regional governments."],
["Describe","Give a detail, characteristic, or example. Show what it looks like.","Describe one effect of gentrification: Rising rents may displace longtime residents."],
["Explain","Show a clear cause-and-effect connection. Words such as 'because,' 'therefore,' or 'this leads to' can help, but no exact connector is required.","Explain: Rising rents displace residents because housing becomes unaffordable for lower-income families."],
["Compare","State one similarity or one difference. Be specific.","Compare core and periphery: Both participate in the global economy, but core countries control high-value production while periphery countries export raw materials."]
];

